{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assume the role of <strong>Zefiro</strong>, a pawn capable of transforming into other <strong>chess pieces</strong>, as he embarks on a perilous <strong>Dantesque journey</strong> in a world ravaged by the <strong>Plague of Angels</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into gloomy and forgotten lands and prepare to face armies of angels: statues and objects inspired by <strong>Italian art and folklore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and unlock all of the armour transformations and their unique abilities in a <strong>dark action-adventure <i>soulslike</i></strong>, where the shield can truly change the outcome of every encounter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secret of the chess pieces and guide Zefiro through <strong>Medhelan</strong> on an <strong>epic quest to return to Heaven.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2982610?t=1761606433","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2982610?t=1761606433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982610/d8539645bae4f792f4b247e2c907b0a356bdf7a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761606433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982610/d8539645bae4f792f4b247e2c907b0a356bdf7a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761606433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3007250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assume the role of <strong>Zefiro</strong>, a pawn capable of transforming into other <strong>chess pieces</strong>, as he embarks on a perilous <strong>Dantesque journey</strong> in a world ravaged by the <strong>Plague of Angels</strong>.</p><p cl